परि-√ मा Ā. -मिमीते (pf. -ममे; Pass. -मीयते; inf. -मातुम्),
to measure round or about, mete out, fulfil, embrace, RV. &c. &c.;
to measure, estimate, determine, MBh.; Kāv. &c.

परि-√ मुच् P. -मुञ्च॑ति (ind.p. -मुच्य; inf. -मोक्तुम्),
to unloose, set free, liberate, deliver from (abl.), AV.; MBh. &c.;
to let go, give up, part with (acc.), Kāv.;
to discharge, emit, Kathās. :
Pass. -मुच्यते (˚ति, MuṇḍUp.), to loosen or free one's self, get rid of (abl. gen. or instr.), RV. &c. &c.;
to be liberated or emancipated (from the ties of the world), Kauś.; Up.

परि-√ मृज् P. -मार्ष्टि, -मृजति, -मार्जति, मार्जयति (rarely Ā., e.g. Pot. -मृजीत, Gobh.; ind.p. -मृज्य; inf. -मार्ष्टुम्, or -मार्जितुम्),
to wipe all round, wash, cleanse, purify, RV. &c. &c.;
 (with चक्षुषी) to wipe tears from the eyes, MBh.; R.;
 (also Ā.) to cleanse or rinse the mouth, Gaut.; Āpast.; Gobh.; MBh.;
to touch lightly, stroke, MBh.;
to wipe off or away, remove, efface, get rid of (acc.), R.; Kālid.; BhP. :
Pass. -मृज्यते, to be rubbed or worn out by use (as teeth), MBh. xii, 5303 :
Intens. -मर्मृज्यते, to sweep over (acc.), RV. i, 95, 8 (Sāy. ‘to cover with radiance’).

परि-√ मृद् P. -मृद्नाति, -मर्दति (ep. also Ā. -मर्दते), to tread or trample down, crush, grind, wear out, MBh.; Kāv.;
to rub, stroke, MBh.;
 rub off, wipe away (as tears), R.;
to excel, surpass, MBh.

परि-√ मृश् P. Ā. -मृशति, ˚ते (pf. -ममर्श; 3. pl. [RV.] -मामृशुः; aor. -अमृक्षत्; ind.p. -मृश्य),
to touch, grasp, seize, RV. &c. &c.;
to examine, consider, inquire into, ib.;
to observe, discover, BhP. :
Pass. -मृश्यते (with पवनैस्), to be touched i.e. fanned by the wind, Suśr.;
to be considered, MBh. :
Intens. -मर्मृशत्, to encompass, clasp, embrace, RV.
